   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Back at the ASK offices late at night, Andrea reaches her breaking point under Hicham's oppressive management style. She corners Gabriel with an audacious, life-altering proposal. Listen to the scene in French first. Don't worry about catching every word.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
