  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "On ne peut plus bosser avec lui.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's walk through this intense late-night agency conspiracy step by step.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "C'est Hicham, je n'en peux plus.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is Hicham, I cannot take it anymore.' Andrea vents her overwhelming frustration with their boss.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Moi, il m'étouffe complètement.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'He is completely suffocating me.' Andrea describes how Hicham micromanages and stifles her work.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Et toi, il t'écrase.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you, he is crushing you.' Andrea points out the cruel pressure Hicham puts on Gabriel.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Ce n'est plus possible.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is no longer possible.' Andrea declares that the current agency dynamic has reached a dead end.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gabriel",
   "t": "Je n'en peux plus non plus.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I cannot take it anymore either.' Gabriel admits that he also feels broken by the hostile environment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Et si on se barrait?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What if we took off?' Andrea floats a bold and unexpected question of rebellion.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gabriel",
   "t": "Quoi? Mais où ça?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What? But where to?' Gabriel is instantly taken aback by her sudden suggestion.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "On prend tous nos talents.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We take all our talent clients.' Andrea envisions bringing their faithful stars along with them.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "On monte notre propre agence!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We set up our own agency!' Andrea presents her grand vision of starting a new venture together.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gabriel",
   "t": "Non, c'est vraiment impossible.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, that is really impossible.' Gabriel recoils at the immense legal and financial obstacles.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "gabriel",
   "t": "C'est beaucoup trop risqué.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'It is much too risky.' Gabriel worries about the terrifying dangers of an agency mutiny.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Évidemment que c'est risqué.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Of course it is risky.' Andrea acknowledges the immense danger with resolute confidence.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Mais on ne sera pas les premiers.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But we will not be the first.' Andrea reminds him that top talent agents split off all the time.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "On serait nos propres patrons!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We would be our own bosses!' Andrea sells the intoxicating freedom of complete independence.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "On ne peut plus bosser avec lui.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
